# ordin-journal: ordin's record of work, reports and files
error-art-delete-in-place = Files in your own folders are moved to the bin, never deleted for good.
error-art-media-type-invalid = The kind of file given isn't valid. Check it and try again.
error-art-path-invalid = That file location isn't valid. Use a location inside its folder that isn't too long.
error-ext-auto-resend = ordin never sends that action again by itself. Send it again yourself if you still need it.
error-ext-destination-invalid = The destination is empty or too long. Enter a shorter one and try again.
error-ext-key-duplicate = That action has already been recorded, so ordin hasn't sent it twice.
error-jrnl-backup-failed = ordin couldn't make a safety copy of its record before updating. Free up some disk space and try again.
error-jrnl-datastore-open-failed = ordin's record couldn't be opened. Close ordin and open it again.
error-jrnl-datastore-unavailable = ordin's record isn't responding. Try again in a moment.
error-jrnl-entry-invalid = That entry couldn't be added to ordin's record because it breaks its rules.
error-jrnl-event-kind-invalid = That kind of event isn't valid, so it wasn't recorded.
error-jrnl-event-too-large = That event holds too much information to be recorded.
error-jrnl-export-invalid = Choose between one and 20 pieces of work to include in the support file.
error-jrnl-ext-state-invalid = That action can't be confirmed in its current state.
error-jrnl-migration-changed = ordin's record was updated in a way this version doesn't recognise. Install the latest ordin.
error-jrnl-migration-duplicate = ordin's record has an update listed twice. Install the latest ordin.
error-jrnl-migration-failed = ordin couldn't update its record, so nothing was changed. Try again.
error-jrnl-not-found = That item couldn't be found in ordin's record.
error-jrnl-plan-not-found = That plan couldn't be found in ordin's record.
error-jrnl-resume-too-old = Too much has happened since you were last here to pick up where you left off. Refresh the view.
error-jrnl-retention-above-company-max = That is more days of history than your company allows. Choose a smaller number.
error-jrnl-retention-invalid = Enter a whole number of days, at least 1.
error-jrnl-schema-behind = ordin's record needs updating before it can be used. Restart ordin to update it.
error-jrnl-schema-newer = ordin's record was saved by a newer version of ordin. Install the latest ordin.
error-jrnl-seq-ahead = Your view is ahead of ordin's record. Refresh it and try again.
error-minutes-body-invalid = The minutes are empty or longer than 1 MB. Shorten them and try again.
error-minutes-source-name-invalid = The name of the meeting's file must be between 1 and 255 characters, with no folder in it.
error-minutes-title-invalid = A title must be between 1 and 120 characters, with no line breaks. Change it and try again.
error-report-active-content = Reports can hold plain text and figures only, with no formulas or scripts. Remove them and try again.
error-report-chart-too-large = That chart has too much in it. Show fewer lines or points.
error-report-currency-mismatch = Money columns need a currency, and other columns can't have one. Fix the column and try again.
error-report-dashboard-name-duplicate = You already have a dashboard with that name. Choose another name.
error-report-figures-out-of-range = A report needs between 1 and 8 key figures. Add or remove some.
error-report-link-outside-workspace = Links in a report can only go to documents or places in your workspace.
error-report-parts-out-of-range = A report needs between 1 and 12 parts. Add or remove some.
error-report-part-no-source = Each part of a report needs at least one source. Add one and try again.
error-report-pie-too-many-slices = A pie chart can show up to 6 slices. Combine some or use a different chart.
error-report-run-has-report = This piece of work already has its report.
error-report-table-too-large = That table is too big. Keep it to 10,000 rows and 30 columns at most.
error-report-title-invalid = A title must be between 1 and 200 characters. Change it and try again.
error-report-too-large = That report is too big to save. Remove some content and try again.
error-rstep-immutable = Steps can't be changed once the work has finished.
error-rstep-line-too-long = Each step must be between 1 and 80 characters. Shorten it and try again.
error-rstep-plan-size-out-of-range = A plan needs between 3 and 7 steps. Add or remove some.
error-rstep-plan-version-gap = A changed plan has to be saved as the next version. Reload the plan and try again.
error-start-duplicate = A report for that subject has already been made for this start.
error-start-list-too-long = A list has too many items, or an item is too long. Shorten it and try again.
error-start-reason-missing = Give a reason of between 1 and 500 characters for the rules that aren't enforced.
error-treq-approval-mismatch = An approval can only go with a decision to ask you first. Try again.
error-treq-immutable = That permission question has been dealt with and can't be changed.
error-treq-name-invalid = The name of the action must be between 1 and 200 characters.
error-treq-undecided = That permission question has not been decided yet, so it can't be recorded as decided.
